* COORD: calculation of coordination numbers
+ Atomic radii for all species
# Atoms i and j are coordinated if distance(i,j) <= fac*(radi+radj), fac = 1.00 
# Radii in bohr
# spc  Z   name    rad  
   1   6     C     1.00 
   2   8     O     1.00 
   3   7     N     1.00 
   4   1     H     1.00 

+ Pair coordination numbers (per non-equivalent atom in the cell)
# id = non-equivalent atom ID. mult = multiplicity. rest = atomic species (by name).
# nid   name   mult  C     O     N     H     total 
   1      C      2     0     0     0     0     0   
   2      O      2     0     0     0     0     0   
   3      N      4     0     0     0     2     2   
   4      H      4     0     0     1     0     1   
   5      H      4     0     0     1     0     1   

